data: {"id": "eac1972a353e46b8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1750", "run_id": "eac1972a353e46b8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经获得了目标 Pod 的基本状态。关键事实：\n- Pod 处于 **Pending** 状态，`nodeName: None`\n- 事件显示：**FailedScheduling** — 3个节点都不匹配 Pod 的 node affinity/selector\n- Pod spec 中有 `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`\n\n这个 nodeSelector 非常可疑 — 它要求节点必须有标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，这看起来是一个特意设置的、用于模拟\"不可用节点\"的选择器。\n\n让我验证集群中是否有节点匹配这个标签：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788408919149, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

