data: {"id": "eac1972a353e46b8-final", "run_id": "eac1972a353e46b8", "seq": 2238, "ts_ms": 1788408946540, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod 的 nodeSelector 配置要求节点包含标签 aiops.lab/unavailable=true，但集群中所有可用节点均不具备该标签，导致调度器无法匹配任何节点（Unschedulable）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `reason=Unschedulable, message=\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"` | 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态的直接原因：调度失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `event.message` | `Warning FailedScheduling  20m (x14 over 85m) ... 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` | 确认调度失败是由 Node Affinity/Selector 不匹配引起的，且持续 85 分钟 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `container.resource_limit.cpu` | `50m` | 上下文证据：CPU 资源请求极低（5m），排除资源不足导致的调度问题 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_status_phase` (Pending) | `value=1` (Pending), `value=0` (Failed) | 确认 Pod 长期维持 Pending 状态，未转为 Failed，符合调度阻塞特征 |\n| 5 | Topology | `node selector check` | `node(s) didn't match` (事实映射) | 确认集群中不存在匹配 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签的节点 |\n\n**证据分析说明：**\nK8s State (证据 1) 和 Event (证据 2) 相互印证，明确指出失败原因为“节点不匹配标签/亲和性”。K8s Config (证据 3) 排除了资源争抢的可能。Metrics (证据 4) 展示了状态的时间延续性，佐证了这是持续的调度配置问题而非瞬时波动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置要求节点具备标签 aiops.lab/unavailable=true → 集群无匹配节点 (3/3) → 调度器判定 Unschedulable → Pod 状态 Pending (长达 85 分钟)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **Pod 调度配置与环境不匹配**。\n\nPod 的 `nodeSelector` 强制要求节点包含 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签，但集群中全部 3 个可用节点均不具备该标签，导致调度器无法将 Pod 调度到任何节点，表现为长期 Pending 状态。该结论由 K8s 事件 `FailedScheduling` 中的 `node affinity/selector` 不匹配信息以及 `PodScheduled=False` 的条件状态共同证实。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 61.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 61.7s (Evidence 56.1s, RCA 5.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 88.385, "metrics": {"run_id": "eac1972a353e46b8", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 88.39509320259094, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 88395.09320259094, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 82379.21905517578, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 17, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 12243.036031723022, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5602.116823196411}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18278.82432937622, "suc